  s06: {
    handle: "section/06"
    type: "section"
    title: "What the Echo Keeps"
    excerpt: "Boof understood, pacing the mossy fork, that the grove was not a memory palace. It was a failure mode of the archive—overflow storage for stories that had been published too cleanly. Each echo offered a false fork: am..."
    route: ^[chapter/02/s06]{open}
  }
  s07: <
    handle: "custom-fool/07"
    type: "custom-fool"
    excerpt: "\"Are you lost?\" the Fool asked, leaning out from behind the hollow cedar where no door had been cut. He brushed pollen from his mismatched sleeves, no longer entirely playful. \"Or have you finally arrived where the pu..."
